{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1765496968\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1765496968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.mp4?t=1765496968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different drones, each with unique flight characteristics and explosive payloads. Upgrade and customize your fleet to fit your playstyle\u2014whether you prefer fast and agile strikes or heavy, powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.poster.avif?t=1765496968\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.webm?t=1765496968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.mp4?t=1765496968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic flight physics, challenging objectives, and explosive action, <i>Kamikaze Strike</i> delivers an exciting blend of pilot skill and tactical combat for drone and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/a85a7de9d52369afae00d61b459948fd.avif?t=1765496968\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902740?t=1765496968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/60897a58e4d8f098a5ddc2087472bfc38b19f829/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765496968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/b24af30bbccc36b91e34f403e9fd15ad3d153b7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765496968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/b24af30bbccc36b91e34f403e9fd15ad3d153b7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765496968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4036490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid